  title         = "Advantages and Limitations of using Successor Features for
                   Transfer in Reinforcement Learning",
  author        = "Lehnert, Lucas and Tellex, Stefanie and Littman, Michael L",
  abstract      = "One question central to Reinforcement Learning is how to
