              environment reward, our method significantly outperforms existing
              approaches and makes progress on tasks where no advancements have
              ever been made without demonstrations. Finally, we show that Motif
              mostly generates intuitive human-aligned behaviors which can be
              steered easily through prompt modifications, while scaling well
              with the LLM size and the amount of information given in the
