  volume    = "abs/2312.09187",
  abstract  = "Building generalist agents that can accomplish many goals in rich
               open-ended environments is one of the research frontiers for
               reinforcement learning. A key limiting factor for building
               generalist agents with RL has been the need for a large number of
               reward functions for achieving different goals. We investigate
